sequenceDiagram
  participant cron as morning_cron.sh
  participant API as routes_api.api_morning
  participant P as morning.build_morning
  participant LLM as Claude opus-4-8
  participant GC as gcal
  participant S as scheduler
  participant FS as data files
  participant CC as cc sidecar

  cron->>API: POST /api/morning (Bearer API_KEY)
  API->>P: to_thread(build_morning)
  P->>FS: read activity_log.json
  P->>LLM: _morning_retrospective
  P->>FS: append durable facts to profile.json
  P->>P: recalibration.recalibrate
  P->>LLM: _purge_stale_notes
  P->>GC: import_gcal_cards(days_ahead=14)
  P->>P: _prune_cron_logs (30 days)
  P->>FS: archive activity_log and moltbook-heartbeat, reset
  Note over P,S: under _RD_LOCK
  P->>S: _roll_and_schedule
  P->>S: layout_day(anchor 10AM, only_ids=restack)
  P->>P: nudge_deadlines.morning_reconcile
  P->>FS: save rd.json
  P->>FS: delete chat.json
  P->>LLM: _dedupe_context
  P->>FS: rewrite profile.json
  P-->>API: result (errors per step)
  API->>CC: cc_client.new_conversation
  CC-->>API: archived, pointer dropped
  API->>API: _post_morning_errors if any
  API->>API: push cards_changed
